    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i moved here 3 months ago for work and i realized today that i could just... stop showing up. not to the job, just in general. like, i walk down the street and no one even looks at me. it's like i'm already invisible. what's even the point of trying to connect when you're basically a ghost anyway?",
