    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hobby groups... right. yeah. but it feels so fake. like i'm just performing to pretend i exist. honestly it feels way less exhausting to just accept that nobody's actually looking for me. if i just stopped trying to force it, wouldn't it be easier to just... let myself disappear?",
